ud83d\udcab From the shy student \ud83d\udcda to the confident businesswoman \ud83d\udcbc\u2014each will challenge you, testing your mind, patience \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f, and charm. \ud83d\udc98</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362480/extras/158ce157cefd061b0b2e703d654c75eb.avif?t=1755067016\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel with interactive mechanics where you take on the role of a manager in a cozy house \ud83c\udfe0 filled with extraordinary residents. \ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa4\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf93</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362480/extras/bf30e4bbe47479bbdc302041525e0f69.poster.avif?t=1755067016\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362480/extras/bf30e4bbe47479bbdc302041525e0f69.webm?t=1755067016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362480/extras/bf30e4bbe47479bbdc302041525e0f69.mp4?t=1755067016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is packed with unexpected challenges \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f, hilarious situations \ud83d\ude02, and heartfelt moments \ud83d\udc96. Build relationships, uncover secrets \ud83e\udd2b, and make choices that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find the balance between your responsibilities and your emotions? Or will the house, full of temptations, become your ultimate test? \ud83d\udd11\u2728 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating comedic storyline with unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive gameplay focused on managing the house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 vibrant and unforgettable heroines, each with a unique story to tell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 12 steamy scenes filled with passion and emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of fetishes to cater to diverse preferences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your story begins now!</strong></p>",
